<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Placement Credit</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  th {
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
  }
  .header-bar {
    background-color: #003366;
    color: white;
    padding: 15px 0;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .header-bar h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 24pt;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 16pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin-top: 20px;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-bar">
    <h1>FAIRLEIGH DICKINSON UNIVERSITY</h1>
  </div>
  <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 20pt; margin-top: 0;">METROPOLITAN CAMPUS</h2>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28pt; margin-top: 10px;">ADVANCED PLACEMENT CREDIT</h1>

  <p>Advanced Placement (AP) courses taken in high school may be eligible for AP credit. For consideration of AP credit, submit all official College Board Advanced Placement Examination scores to FDU's Admissions Office for evaluation.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">AP Credit Equivalencies</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">MAJOR</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">AP EXAMINATION</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">AP SCORE MINIMUM</th>
        <th style="width: 35%;">AP EQUIVALENCIES</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">CREDITS</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for major_data in major_credit_data %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="major_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].major">{{ major_data.major }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].ap_examination">{{ major_data.ap_examination }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].ap_score_minimum">{{ major_data.ap_score_minimum }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].ap_equivalencies">{{ major_data.ap_equivalencies }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ major_data.credits }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="note">*Maximum credits listed are subject to institutional policy.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-bar">
    <h1>FAIRLEIGH DICKINSON UNIVERSITY</h1>
  </div>
  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">AP Credit Equivalencies (Continued)</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">MAJOR</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">AP EXAMINATION</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">AP SCORE MINIMUM</th>
        <th style="width: 35%;">AP EQUIVALENCIES</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;">CREDITS</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for major_data in major_credit_data_page2 %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="major_data_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].major">{{ major_data.major }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].ap_examination">{{ major_data.ap_examination }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].ap_score_minimum">{{ major_data.ap_score_minimum }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].ap_equivalencies">{{ major_data.ap_equivalencies }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_data_page2[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ major_data.credits }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px;">IB Credit Options</h3>
  <p>Students with higher-level International Baccalaureate (IB) exam scores of 5 or higher in select subjects may also be eligible for advanced standing. To see which subjects may qualify you for credit, contact your admissions counselor at <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span>.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ccc;">
    <p>For questions or more information, contact:</p>
    <p>Admissions Office</p>
    <p><span data-field="admissions_phone">{{ admissions_phone }}</span></p>
    <p><span data-field="admissions_email">{{ admissions_email }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>